> References

- [Lan et al. (2020), ALBERT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.11942).
- [Sanh et al. (2019), DistilBERT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.01108).
- [Liu et al. (2019), RoBERTa](https://arxiv.org/abs/1907.11692).
